istic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/previewInterfaceOrientation(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"previewInterfaceOrientation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"InterfaceOrientation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI20InterfaceOrientationV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/previewInterfaceOrientation(_:)","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/previewinterfaceorientation(_:)","title":"previewInterfaceOrientation(_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}